# a-second-request

An administrator closes the account choosing that alice's memes be kept and anonymised, and 
alice asks for the same closure herself at some point while it runs. The second request 
joins the running case and drops its conditions — which changes what the participants do to 
the rows, mid-case, and the parts may already have been commanded under the old ones. 

